WEBVTT

00:03:29.057 --> 00:03:30.759
They were deeply relaxed,

00:03:30.759 --> 00:03:32.077
they felt comforted,

00:03:32.077 --> 00:03:33.495
they felt calmed

00:03:33.495 --> 00:03:36.882
and they had these light,
sparkly brain tingles.

00:03:38.266 --> 00:03:40.168
And I also noticed

00:03:40.168 --> 00:03:42.587
that every scenario they described

00:03:42.587 --> 00:03:44.639
that stimulated their ASMR

00:03:44.639 --> 00:03:45.841
had a simple theme to it.

00:03:46.541 --> 00:03:51.046
It was always when they were receiving
positive personal attention

00:03:51.046 --> 00:03:52.831
from a kind and caring individual.

00:03:54.433 --> 00:03:58.136
And the examples they gave
were very similar to my moments.

00:03:58.837 --> 00:04:01.072
It was moments with hairdressers;